{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"pass\": false,\n  \"problems\": [\n    \"第6条不满足。第1至3条选中的候选解释本身确实是原话，但“新确立的历史”没有只做补指代、删重复和前后拼接，而是把M2改写成“第一次带来了能够真切体会、愿意反复停留其中的快乐”“真实但有限的满足”“更清楚”等概括。其中“愿意反复停留”还把原来的“能够安心地沉浸其中”改成了额外的反复停留倾向。这不是单纯拼接原话，严格按第6条必须判不合格。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-B2\",\n      \"why\": \"池子太窄\",\n      \"note\": \"左手如心跳和水浪、身体被托举、放弃重力控制的具体身体感受，没有被候选解释充分说明。时间持续流动的部分已经为M28提供了依据。将其余身体质感独立保留是合理的，不必另造人物经历来解释；它不是主线缺口，但也不能说已经获得了心理因果解释。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"主线的亲近甜蜜、甜中不舍和末尾回柔基本都有连贯的因果解释，B2的独立保留也不构成借口。但新确立的历史改写并抽象化了候选原话，还加入了原文没有明确表达的反复停留倾向；即使其余选择基本成立，仍因第6条不满足而整体不合格。\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "788db7f9-584d-47bc-af5b-c8ca1d54768c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T022211860569Z", "elapsed_seconds": 401.531, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T02:28:53.393120+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c8e5f8dd83446f29ee708565865ecfb581327b50863698b5df5d27ed2526acfd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec